  "invariants": {
    "status": "present",
    "value": [
      "Given a valid parent-index rooted tree, aggregate child replies bottom-up. Return the node count and topology rendered as id(child1,child2), omitting parentheses for leaves and ordering children by numeric ID. Empty input returns count zero and empty topology. This is a local adjacency-only protocol model, not a deployed distributed implementation.",
      "Observing a result must not change earlier returned snapshots or mutate input containers."
    ],
